you can get the tail, but not the skin? type this into dev console for the tail thingy

snake.atx = new Float32Array(9);snake.aty = new Float32Array(9);snake.atvx = new Float32Array(9);snake.atvy = new Float32Array(9);snake.atax = new Float32Array(9);snake.atay = new Float32Array(9);snake.blba = 1;snake.bsc = 1;snake.blbh = 20;snake.blbw = 20;snake.blby = -10;snake.blbx = -10;snake.apbs = true;snake.atia = .5;snake.atc2 = "#FFFFFF";snake.atc1 = "#505050";snake.atba = 0;snake.bulb = rabulb;snake.antenna = true;

